# Everything checks out LF, on Windows too. The index is already all LF, but
# with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout turned every text file CRLF, and
# that broke two things the cloud (LF) never saw:
# - Claude Code's frontmatter loader silently drops an agent whose file is
#   CRLF *and* whose description has an unquoted ": " — all 27 of them.
# - The source-scanning tests (stickyFooterModals, testIdConvention,
#   cascadeDeleteBatch) match patterns across lines and failed on CRLF only.
* text=auto eol=lf
